WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:06.000
Can there be peace?

00:07.666 --> 00:09.700
Not in my generation.

00:11.033 --> 00:14.600
Maybe in my childs, in your generation, will be peace.

00:15.200 --> 00:16.333
Not in ours,

00:17.000 --> 00:18.333
there will be no peace.

00:19.000 --> 00:20.700
We have to make

00:22.500 --> 00:25.366
a good life before we are doing the peace,

00:26.000 --> 00:30.200
we have to make a good life here, and there.

00:33.900 --> 00:36.300
I don't care

00:36.300 --> 00:40.233
if Muhammad will be Muslim or Christian

00:41.066 --> 00:43.966
or Bedouin or Jew or everything.

00:44.033 --> 00:45.400
I don't care.

00:45.400 --> 00:49.366
I want him to be whatever he wants.

00:50.233 --> 00:52.266
But you have to to know,

00:52.266 --> 00:55.333
I have to make him think

00:55.333 --> 01:00.133
that I want to be a Jew in Israel, in Kfar Aza,

01:00.133 --> 01:01.300
and I want to live here.

01:02.600 --> 01:07.733
If I'll be able to make him think in this way

01:07.933 --> 01:09.633
there will be peace.

01:09.633 --> 01:14.033
40, 30 years from now, maybe.

01:17.500 --> 01:18.433
It's no matter:

01:18.433 --> 01:20.200
I don't want to go

01:20.200 --> 01:21.600
to the market in Gaza.

01:21.600 --> 01:23.333
I have it in Be'er Scheva,

01:23.333 --> 01:26.100
I have it in Ashkelon, I have it in Sderot.

01:26.333 --> 01:27.333
It's ok.

01:27.333 --> 01:30.933
I will not go to the sea in Gaza.

01:31.233 --> 01:34.833
Beautiful beach, in Gaza.

01:37.233 --> 01:39.466
If I want a good place,

01:39.466 --> 01:43.233
I will go to Germany.

01:45.033 --> 01:49.633
I have all the world, but I want to live here.

01:49.833 --> 01:54.000
I want that my home will be the place that I'm going from,

01:54.300 --> 01:57.166
from my home I will go to Stuttgart,

01:57.300 --> 01:59.900
I will go to, where are you from?

02:00.433 --> 02:01.300
Würzburg

02:01.833 --> 02:03.633
I will go to Würzburg!

02:05.400 --> 02:06.400
But from here.

02:06.400 --> 02:08.666
This is my home. I want to live here.

02:08.666 --> 02:10.266
I want to live good.

02:10.766 --> 02:11.666
I want

02:12.366 --> 02:15.800
to let my grandchild live here

02:15.800 --> 02:17.833
in a good life.

02:19.800 --> 02:22.800
I don't want him to be afraid from every boom.

02:22.800 --> 02:24.133
And he his.
